WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.728
Confirm the exact school and record. This uses the real app editor with synthetic training records. Check the school, family or employee before changing a field.

00:00:10.728 --> 00:00:22.725
Verify the actual image and permission. Before using these controls in normal work, inspect the photo, every visible child and the signed permissions. No image is submitted here.

00:00:22.725 --> 00:00:33.117
Prepare an audit note. Use a concise factual note. Do not treat a note as a substitute for checking permission.

00:00:33.117 --> 00:00:43.509
Understand the sharing action. Approve and share makes the approved image available to linked parents. It is not simply an internal approval.

00:00:43.509 --> 00:00:53.901
Review before saving. Use Reject sharing when the image is unsuitable or permission is unresolved. No approval or rejection is submitted in this recording.

